{
  "title": "JAMANVAAR — Platform Control Center",
  "text": "PLATFORM CONTROL\nPlatform Owner\nPLATFORM CONTROL CENTER\nExecutive Dashboard\nBUSINESS MANAGEMENT\nRestaurants\nRestaurant Owners\nBranches\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Billing\nSAAS MANAGEMENT\nPlans & Entitlements\nFeature Catalog\nQR Ordering Suite\nWhatsApp Ordering\nJAMAN AI Engine\nMaster Menu Catalog\nActivation Keys\nPayment Gateways\nPlatform Payments\nRestaurant Payouts\nApplications & Releases\nOPERATIONS & MDM\nDevice Fleet / MDM\nSync & Conflict Monitor\nBackups & Recovery\nSystem Telemetry\nStaging Sandboxes\nSECURITY & REPORTS\nReports & Analytics\nAudit Logs\nEmergency Offline Policy\nPlatform Team\nSupport Tickets\nDiagnostics & Support\nPlatform Settings\nACCOUNT\nMy Profile\nPlatform Online\nJAMANVAAR Cloud v1.4.0\nJAMANVAAR PLATFORM\nControl Center\nCtrl+K\nPLATFORM ONLINE\nJ\nJAMANVAAR Super Admin\nPlatform Owner\nLogout\nPlatform Settings\n\nGlobal SaaS parameters, default onboarding quotas, statutory business metadata, and platform maintenance mode.\n\nPlatform Branding\n\nThe support email and phone appear on every invoice and at the foot of every email the platform sends.\n\nPLATFORM NAME *\nPARENT COMPANY *\nSUPPORT EMAIL *\nSUPPORT PHONE\nSave Branding\nInvoice seller details\n\nPrinted on every invoice and receipt. Check these are your real company and bank details before invoicing.\n\nTRADE NAME\nShown as the seller on invoices\nLEGAL NAME\nADDRESS\nCITY\nSTATE\nDecides CGST + SGST (same state as the restaurant) or IGST\nPIN CODE\nGSTIN\nIts first two digits must match the state\nPAN\n10 characters, e.g. AAACK7890F (optional)\nSAC CODE\nBANK\nACCOUNT NAME\nACCOUNT NUMBER\nIFSC\nUPI ID\nBILLING EMAIL\nLeave empty to use the support email above\nSave seller details\nOnboarding Default Quotas\n\nDefault allocation when new restaurants are provisioned\n\nDEFAULT TRIAL DURATION (DAYS) *\nMAX OUTLETS PER TRIAL *\nMAX TERMINALS PER TRIAL *\nSave Quotas\nMaintenance & Alerts\n\nGlobal platform announcements and maintenance broadcast\n\nPlatform Maintenance Mode\n\nWhen saved as ON, every restaurant app (Restaurant Admin, POS, KDS, Captain, Kiosk) shows this notice at the top of the screen. It never stops billing: terminals keep working offline without losing local data.\n\nGLOBAL STATUS BANNER MESSAGE\n0/500. Leave empty to show a standard maintenance message.\nSTARTS AT (OPTIONAL)\nENDS AT (OPTIONAL)\nWithout times the notice shows until you switch it off. With times it appears and disappears by itself.\nOff: no notice is being shown to restaurants.\nSave notice\nKELVIONTECH ENTERPRISE\nCloud Control Active\nENTERPRISE MULTI-TENANT CLOUD CONTROL\nv2.0 • POWERED BY KELVIONTECH\n\nJAMANVAAR CLOUD PLATFORM CONTROL\n\nSUPER ADMIN\nCore Engine Ready\n•\nCloud Database Connected\n•\nMulti-Tenant Active",
